<title>POLAND: Handlowy, KGHM to join WIG 20.</title>
<headline>Handlowy, KGHM to join WIG 20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Bank Handlowy SA and copper producer KGHM Polska Miedz SA will join the large-cap WIG 20 index on September 22, replacing BIG SA and Stomil Olsztyn SA, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>The Thursday statement said that BIG and Stomil Olsztyn would leave the WIG 20 index because of limits on the number of companies on Warsaw's blue chip index from the same sector.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
